{"additions":164,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Pure move of `nest_by` / `TreePos` (and their tests) from `github::panes::gh_list` to `core::tree`, re-exported from `gh_list`. Upcoming pages (Docker compose projects, process trees, Actions job steps) reuse the builder without depending on the GitHub module.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":3,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:20:36Z","deletions":160,"headRefName":"refactor/core-tree","labels":[],"number":108,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLO6j5Q","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe change is a straightforward extraction with preserved re-exports and tests moved intact, and no broken references were found.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nMoves the generic tree layout builder (`nest_by` + `TreePos`) out of the GitHub-specific list pane into `core::tree`, so other (non-GitHub) pages can reuse the nesting + guide-prefix logic without depending on the GitHub module.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Extracted `nest_by` / `TreePos` (and unit tests) into a new `src/core/tree.rs` module.\n- Re-exported `nest_by` / `TreePos` from `github::panes::gh_list` to preserve existing call sites and public paths.\n- Registered the new `core::tree` module in `src/core/mod.rs`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/github/panes/gh_list.rs | Removes the in-file tree layout implementation and re-exports `core::tree` APIs to keep existing imports working. |\r\n| src/core/tree.rs | New shared core module containing `TreePos`, `nest_by`, and the moved unit tests. |\r\n| src/core/mod.rs | Exposes the new `tree` module under `core`. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<